{"seq":2,"slug":"price-formation","title":"价格形成机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"order-book-dynamics","title":"订单簿动态与价格发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/order-book-dynamics","wordCount":2771,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"bid-ask-spread","title":"买卖价差模型与信息不对称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/bid-ask-spread","wordCount":2720,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-impact-models","title":"市场冲击模型与最优执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/price-formation/market-impact-models","wordCount":2819,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"价格形成机制\">价格形成机制</h1><p>本章深入探讨证券价格如何从分散的买卖行为中涌现。从订单簿的微观动态出发，分析限价订单和市价订单如何交互形成价格发现过程；然后系统梳理买卖价差的理论模型，包括存货模型和信息模型，理解价差如何反映做市成本和信息不对称；最后讨论市场冲击模型，探索大额订单执行对价格的影响以及最优执行策略的设计。价格形成机制是市场微观结构理论的核心。</p>\n"}